{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14881","headline":"江北忆崔汶 · 卢纶","name":"江北忆崔汶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜问江西客，还知在楚乡。\n全身出部伍，尽室逐渔商。\n晴日游瓜步，新年对汉阳。\n月昏惊浪白，瘴起觉云黄。\n望岭家何处，登山泪几行。\n闽中传有雪，应且住南康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}